<?php $updated='July 29, 2026'; ?><!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Privacy Policy | Beyond OS</title><style>body{margin:0;background:#090912;color:#eee;font:16px/1.75 system-ui}.page{max-width:820px;margin:auto;padding:50px 24px}a{color:#a78bfa}h1{font-size:44px;line-height:1.05}h2{margin-top:34px}.muted{color:#9999ab}.app-back{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:42px;padding:9px 15px;border:1px solid rgba(167,139,250,.4);border-radius:999px;background:rgba(167,139,250,.1);color:inherit!important;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none}.app-back:hover{background:rgba(167,139,250,.2)}</style></head><body><main class="page"><a class="app-back" href="register.php">← Back to registration</a><h1>Privacy Policy</h1><p class="muted">Version 2.0 · Effective <?= $updated ?></p><p>This policy describes how Beyond OS handles information connected to Beyond ID and its applications.</p><h2>Information collected</h2><p>We collect account details such as name, email, security credentials in hashed form, app activity, wallet transactions, preferences, and technical information needed to operate and protect the service.</p><h2>How information is used</h2><p>Information is used to authenticate you, connect your apps, operate your wallet, personalize experiences, provide requested communications, prevent abuse, and improve the ecosystem.</p><h2>First-party traffic analytics</h2><p>Beyond OS measures page views, active visits, app usage, device category, operating system, browser family, viewport size, language, timezone, referring domain, country code, and IP address to understand performance, troubleshoot access, and improve the service. IP addresses are available only in the restricted administrator view and are cleared after 30 days. Visitor and session identifiers are one-way hashed using a private key stored outside the public web root. Full browser user-agent strings, URL query parameters, and referrer query parameters are not stored. Browser Do Not Track signals are respected.</p><h2>Sharing</h2><p>Connected Beyond apps receive the minimum identity and wallet context needed to function. We do not sell your personal information. Providers may process limited information to deliver hosting, email, security, payment, or analytics services.</p><h2>Retention and security</h2><p>We retain information while your account is active and as needed for legal, security, and operational obligations. Reasonable safeguards are used, but no online system can guarantee absolute security.</p><h2>Your choices</h2><p>You may request access, correction, or deletion where applicable and can unsubscribe from optional marketing messages. Essential identity and security messages may still be sent.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>Privacy questions and requests may be sent through the official support contact published by Beyond Imagination Corp.</p></main><script src="/assets/js/visitor-analytics.js" defer></script></body></html>
